/scratch/

# GPU trace captures — NEVER commit. Commercial .xtr traces embed guest
# physical memory (game code, textures, assets); decoded EDRAM snapshots and
# framebuffer PNGs embed game imagery. The local commercial corpus lives at
# $XENIA_TRACE_CORPUS (see tools/gpu_trace_analysis/README.md), outside the repo.
*.xtr
*.edram.bin
manifest.jsonl
capture_meta.json

/build/
/build-arm64/
/build-x64/

# macOS distribution build artifacts (the .app/.dmg live under /build/dist and
# are already covered by /build/; these catch outputs produced elsewhere and
# Mac-specific build cruft). The committed packaging inputs - package_mac.sh,
# Info.plist.in, xenia.dist.entitlements, xenia.icns - are NOT ignored.
*.dmg
*.dSYM/
**/xcuserdata/

